  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1765486813_4251980_162809b3a22232ad10ae0de553b6d01c.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\">🤝 Partner with Purpose: Join the Passion 4 Health Affiliate Program</h3><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\">At Passion 4 Health, we’re not just selling supplements — we’re building a purpose-driven wellness brand rooted in integrity, transparency, and real impact.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\">We invite creators, educators, and wellness advocates to partner with a family-owned brand that puts<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>health first</strong>,<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>quality without compromise</strong>, and<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>giving back at the core of everything we do</strong>.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\">If your audience values clean ingredients, ethical brands, and products that genuinely work — this program is built for you.</p><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><br></h3><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\">🌟 Why Partner with Passion 4 Health</h3><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\">Our affiliate program is designed to be simple, trustworthy, and conversion-friendly — so you can confidently recommend products your audience will love.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><strong>🔹 15% Commission on Every Order</strong><br>Earn a 15% commission on every sale generated through your unique affiliate link or coupon code, year-round.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><strong>🔹 Exclusive 10% Customer Discount</strong><br>Your audience receives a 10% discount on their first purchase, helping drive faster conversions and repeat customers.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><strong>🔹 High-Converting Product Format</strong><br>Our liquid supplements are easy to take, gentle on digestion, and address common pain points like pill fatigue, stomach discomfort, and poor absorption — making them easier to recommend and easier to sell.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><strong>🔹 Purpose-Driven Brand Alignment</strong><br>We donate<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>5% of every purchase</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>to our registered non-profit,<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><em>Passion 4 K.I.D.S.</em><br>This isn’t a marketing campaign — the charity existed long before our supplement brand and is the foundation of our mission.</p><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><br></h3><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\">🔬 What Makes Our Products Different</h3><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\">The wellness space is crowded with pills, gummies, and water-based liquids. Passion 4 Health stands apart.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><strong>✔ Aloe Vera–Based Liquid Formula</strong><br>Instead of water, our supplements use a premium aloe vera base that supports digestion and enhances nutrient absorption.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\">• Improved bioavailability compared to pills and gummies<br>• Gentle on the stomach<br>• Easier daily compliance for your audience</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><strong>✔ Clean, Verified &amp; Transparent</strong><br>We go beyond minimum standards to ensure trust:</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\">•<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>Clean Label Certified™</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>— independently tested for over 200 contaminants<br>•<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>BBB A+ Rating</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>— a strong trust signal for consumers<br>• Premium bioavailable ingredients, including methylated B-vitamins and fulvic trace minerals</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><strong>✔ Made with Integrity</strong><br>As a family-owned company, quality control and ethical sourcing are personal commitments — not buzzwords.</p><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><br></h3><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\">🎤 Key Talking Points for Promotion</h3><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\">When promoting Passion 4 Health, these angles resonate most with audiences:</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\">• “Liquid vitamins absorb better than pills — no fillers, no binders.”<br>• “Aloe vera makes it easier on digestion and helps nutrients actually work.”<br>• “Clean Label Certified and BBB A+ rated — this brand takes trust seriously.”<br>• “5% of every purchase goes directly to helping children in need.”<br>• “Use my code for 10% off and skip the pills.”</p><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><br></h3><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\">🚀 Who This Program Is Best For</h3><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\">✔ Content creators &amp; influencers<br>✔ Wellness educators<br>✔ Bloggers &amp; SEO publishers<br>✔ Health-focused communities<br>✔ Ethical deal &amp; coupon creators (approved codes only)</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\">We review applications manually to ensure alignment and protect long-term conversion quality for our partners.</p></div>",
